{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50733","headline":"题重玄寺阁八韵 · 张祜","name":"题重玄寺阁八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱阁鳞虚构，环瞻极水乡。\n青螺蔟山色，白练展湖光。\n矗户浮云过，斜轩早鴈翔。\n万檐攒肆邸，千叶溢津航。\n叠供儳寒碧，飞窗漏夕阳。\n月轮霄辗栋，风铎曙铿廊。\n塔耸尖层出，河萦小派长。\n因还九霄上，凝步独成章。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}